oka, mutane za su yi abin da suka ga dama, sai hayaniya da matsala su ƙaru. Ka bi doka cikin natsuwa, ka tambayi babba idan ba ka gane ba. Yaro mai bin doka yana samun aminci, ilimi, da girmamawa daga mutane. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Dokoki a Gida da Makaranta. [MAIN] Dokoki su ne ƙa’idoji da suke taimaka wa mutane su zauna lafiya cikin tsari. A gida, iyaye na iya cewa ka wanke hannu kafin cin abinci, ka dawo da kaya wurinsu, ko ka yi magana cikin ladabi. A makaranta, malamai na iya cewa ka zo da wuri, ka saurara a aji, ka ɗaga hannu kafin magana, kuma ka kula da littafi. Dokoki ba don tsoro kawai ba ne; suna kare ka da sauran mutane. [PAUSE 1] Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-08.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-08.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"tsari\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"tsari\",\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"rashin ladabi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"ɗaga hannu\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"ɗaga hannu\",\n          \"yin ihu\",\n          \"barin aji\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me dokoki suke taimakawa a gida da makaranta?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"tsari\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"rashin ladabi\",\n          \"faɗa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me ya kamata ka yi kafin magana a aji?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"ɗaga hannu\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"yin ihu\",\n          \"barin aji\",\n          \"buga teburi\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane doka ce ta gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"wanke hannu kafin abinci\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"jefa shara\",\n          \"ɓoye littafi\",\n          \"gudu da wuƙa\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me doka take yi wa mutane?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"kare su\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ɓata su\",\n          \"tsoratar da su kawai\",\n          \"raba su\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Yaro mai bin doka yana samun me?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"girmamawa\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"rashin aminci\",\n          \"faɗa\",\n          \"tsokana\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"p2-socs-09\",\n    \"gradeband\": \"p2\",\n    \"subject\": \"Social Studies\",\n    \"subjectHa\": \"Nazarin Zamantakewa\",\n    \"moduleNumber\": 9,\n    \"titleEn\": \"Leaders in the Community\",\n    \"titleHa\": \"Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma\",\n    \"titleAjami\": null,\n    \"ajami_validated\": false,\n    \"textExplanationHa\": \"Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. Shugaba mai kyau yana sauraren mutane, yana ƙarfafa zaman lafiya, kuma yana taimaka wa jama’a su kiyaye doka. Wannan darasi ba batun jam’iyya ba ne; yana koya maka ma’anar jagoranci cikin sauƙi. Ya kamata ka girmama shugabanni masu kyau, ka bi umarni na aminci, kuma ka faɗa wa babba idan wani umarni ya sa ka cikin haɗari. Kai ma za ka iya nuna jagoranci ta hanyar gaskiya, taimako, da ladabi. Ka sake duba misali a gida ko makaranta, sannan ka faɗa wa babba abin da ka koya.\",\n    \"textExplanationAjami\": null,\n    \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Zamantakewa. Yau za mu koyi Shugabanni a Cikin Al’umma. [MAIN] Shugabanni a cikin al’umma mutane ne da suke taimaka wa jama’a su bi tsari. A gida, iyaye suna jagorantar yara. A makaranta, shugaban makaranta da malamai suna taimaka wa ɗalibai. A unguwa, ana iya samun mai unguwa ko dattijo da mutane suke saurara saboda kwarewa da ladabi. [PAUSE 1] Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida? [MAIN] Ka haɗa darasin da abin da kake gani a gida, makaranta, kasuwa, ko unguwa. Ka yi tunani a hankali, ka nuna ladabi, sannan ka tambayi babba idan kana bukatar ƙarin bayani. [PAUSE 2] Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa? [OUTRO] Ka ci gaba da lura da rayuwar al’umma. Kyakkyawan hali yana taimaka maka ka zauna lafiya da mutane.\",\n    \"audioFile\": \"audio/p2-socs-09.mp3\",\n    \"imageCard\": \"images/p2-socs-09.png\",\n    \"microPauses\": [\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 90000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"iyaye\",\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"pauseAtMs\": 150000,\n        \"questionHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"correctAnswer\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"options\": [\n          \"sauraro\",\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"quizQuestions\": [\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke jagorantar yara a gida?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"iyaye\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"ƙwallo\",\n          \"hanya\",\n          \"kujera\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wa ke taimaka wa ɗalibai a makaranta?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"malamai\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"direbobi kawai\",\n          \"masu wasa\",\n          \"ƙananan yara\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Wane hali shugaba mai kyau yake nunawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"sauraro\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"rashin gaskiya\",\n          \"faɗa kullum\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Me shugaba mai kyau yake ƙarfafawa?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"zaman lafiya\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"hayaniya\",\n          \"ƙin doka\",\n          \"ɓata hanya\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"templateHa\": \"Ta yaya yaro zai nuna jagoranci?\",\n        \"answerFormula\": \"taimako da ladabi\",\n        \"variableRanges\": {\n          \"a\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          },\n          \"b\": {\n            \"min\": 0,\n            \"max\": 0\n          }\n        },\n        \"distractorFormulas\": [\n          \"tsokana\",\n          \"ɓoye gaskiya\",\n          \"ƙin sauraro\"\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"track\": \"formal\",\n    \"targetAudience\": \"youth\",\n    \"gapTeaser\": null,\n    \"chainNext\": null,\n    \"isChainLeaf\": true,\n    \"useTodayPrompt\": null\n  }\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
