{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"grep -RniE 'gadon al|al.adunmu|gado.*al.adu|musayar kaya|kiwon dabbobi|Eid|Christmas|Kirsimeti|Sabuwar Doya|doya|UNCRC|haƙƙin yara|intanet' app/content.json tools tasks docs | head -120\"","aggregated_output":"app/content.json:12100:            \"Hoto daga intanet ba tare da izini ba\",\napp/content.json:12197:            \"Hoto daga intanet ba tare da izini ba\",\napp/content.json:12244:        \"ha\": \"Amma yayin da kasuwa ta shiga intanet, matsalar da ke tafe ita ce yadda za ka gane zamba kafin ka fada ciki.\",\napp/content.json:12261:      \"titleHa\": \"Gane Zamba (419/yaudara ta Intanet)\",\napp/content.json:12264:        \"ha\": \"Gane Zamba (419/yaudara ta Intanet)\",\napp/content.json:12269:        \"ha\": \"Darasin nan yana koya alamun zamba a sakon waya, asusun banki, da tallan intanet. Ka koyi yadda za ka dakata, ka tantance, sannan ka kare kuɗinka kafin ka amsa.\",\napp/content.json:12272:      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Darasin nan yana koya alamun zamba a sakon waya, asusun banki, da tallan intanet. Ka koyi yadda za ka dakata, ka tantance, sannan ka kare kuɗinka kafin ka amsa. Alamun ja na zamba. Sako da ke matsa maka ka gaggauta, ya ɓoye cikakken bayani, ko ya nemi lambar sirri yana bukatar ka tsaya. Gaskiyar kasuwanci tana yarda a bincika. Zamba na nufin Dabara ta yaudara domin a karɓi kuɗi ko bayanai ba da gaskiya ba. Tabbatarwa na nufin Binciken hujja kafin a yarda da sako, mutum, ko biyan kuɗi. Misalin hoton canji na bogi. Wani ya turo wa Bello hoton transfer ya ce ya gama biya, ya nemi a saki kaya nan take. Bello ya duba asusunsa, bai ga kudi ba, don haka ya jira tabbacin banki kafin ya bada kaya. Jiran tabbacin gaskiya ya ceci Bello daga asara. Ka duba link da lambobi. Kar ka danna link daga wanda ba ka sani ba kuma kar ka raba lambar sirri. Idan labari ya yi kyau fiye da kima, ka nemi wata hujja daga hanya ta daban.\",\napp/content.json:13254:            \"Eh, idan kasuwa tana kan intanet\",\napp/content.json:13351:            \"Eh, idan kasuwa tana kan intanet\",\napp/content.json:13444:      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Bankin dijital yana sa biyan kaya, tara kuɗi, da aika kudi su yi sauri. Amma dole ne a tabbatar da suna, sirri, da tarihin ciniki kafin a danna amincewa. Ka tsaya kafin ka danna amincewa. A USSD ko manhajar banki, ka duba suna, adadi, da dalilin biyan kuɗi kafin ka tabbatar. Gaggawa ce ke sa mafi yawan kuskure. USSD na nufin Lambar da ake bugawa a waya domin yin ayyukan banki ba tare da intanet ba. Tarihin ciniki na nufin Jerinhin rubuce-rubucen biyan kuɗi da karɓa da aka yi. Misalin biyan kaya ga mai kaya. Zainab ta shirya tura kudi ga mai kawo mata leda. Kafin ta tabbatar, ta sake dubawa ta ga harafin suna ya bambanta da wanda ta saba gani, sai ta dakatar ta kira mai kayan. Sake duba suna ya hana ta aikawa ga asusun da ba daidai ba. Ka kare wayarka. Ka ɓoye lambar sirri, ka kulle wayarka, kuma ka duba sakon tabbatarwa bayan kowace mu'amala. Idan waya ta bace, ka kira banki nan da nan.\",\napp/content.json:13468:            \"ha\": \"Lambar da ake bugawa a waya domin yin ayyukan banki ba tare da intanet ba.\",\napp/content.json:13883:          \"templateHa\": \"Kafin ka cika form a intanet, me ya kamata ka duba?\",\napp/content.json:13980:          \"templateHa\": \"Kafin ka cika form a intanet, me ya kamata ka duba?\",\napp/content.json:40323:      \"textExplanationHa\": \"Yara suna bukatar abinci iri-iri domin girma, motsa jiki, da lafiya. Abincin bada kuzari, kamar tuwo, shinkafa, gero, doya, ko rogo, yana taimaka wa jiki yin wasa da aiki. Abincin gina jiki, kamar wake, ƙwai, kifi, gyada, ko nama gwargwadon hali, yana taimaka wa jiki ya gina sassa yayin girma. Abincin kariya, kamar kabewa, alayyahu, tumatir, mangwaro, gwanda, ko lemu, yana kawo sinadarai masu taimaka wa jiki ya zauna lafiya. Ruwa mai tsafta yana taimaka wa jiki yin ayyukansa. Iri-iri yana da muhimmanci domin rukuni ɗaya ba ya yin dukkan ayyukan. Ka kwatanta abinci biyu: tuwo da miya mai alayyahu da wake yana haɗa kuzari, gina jiki, da kariya; biskit da abin sha mai zaƙi ba su ba da irin wannan bambanci. Ba sai abinci ya yi tsada ba. A zaɓi abin da ake samu a gida, a wanke hannu da sabulu kafin ci, kuma a sha ruwa mai tsafta.\",\napp/content.json:40325:      \"audioScript\": \"[INTRO] Sannu da zuwa darasin Kimiyya. Yau za mu koyi yadda abinci iri-iri yake taimaka wa girma cikin lafiya. [MAIN] Tuwo, shinkafa, gero, doya, da rogo suna bada kuzari. Wake, ƙwai, kifi, da gyada suna taimakawa gina jiki. Kayan lambu da 'ya'yan itatuwa suna taimaka wa jiki ya zauna lafiya. [PAUSE 1] Wane aiki abincin gina jiki yake yi? [MAIN] Ruwa mai tsafta yana taimaka wa ayyukan jiki. Tuwo da miya mai alayyahu da wake yana da rukuni iri-iri fiye da biskit da abin sha mai zaƙi. Abinci na gida mai araha zai iya haɗa nau'ikan da ake bukata. A wanke hannu kafin ci. [PAUSE 2] Wane abinci ne ya fi haɗa rukuni iri-iri? [OUTRO] Ka kwatanta abincin rana biyu ta aikin kowane rukuni, sannan ka nuna yadda za a ƙara iri-iri da abin da ake samu a gida.\",\nBinary file tools/image-pipeline/poc/ajami-unvalidated-proof.png matches\ntools/image-pipeline/generate/style-b-archetype-queue.json:14:      \"moduleId\": \"p2-bsci-16\",\ntools/image-pipeline/generate/style-b-archetype-queue.json:32:      \"moduleId\": \"p4-bsci-18\",\ntools/image-pipeline/generate/style-b-archetype-queue.json:50:      \"moduleId\": \"p3-maths-02\",\ntools/image-pipeline/generate/client.mjs:19:  for (const key of [\"id\", \"status\", \"moduleId\", \"prompt\", \"negativePrompt\", \"output\", \"labelSource\"]) if (!job[key]) throw new Error(`${job.id || \"unknown\"}: missing ${key}`);\ntools/image-pipeline/generate/client.mjs:52:    const provenance = { jobId: job.id, status: \"generated\", startedAt, completedAt: new Date().toISOString(), request, requestSha256: digest(JSON.stringify(request)), artifactPath, artifactSha256: digest(artifact), respons