. Tuwo da miya mai alayyahu da wake yana da rukuni iri-iri fiye da biskit da abin sha mai zaƙi. Abinci na gida mai araha zai iya haɗa nau'ikan da ake bukata. A wanke hannu kafin ci. [PAUSE 2] Wane abinci ne ya fi haɗa rukuni iri-iri? [OUTRO] Ka kwatanta abincin rana biyu ta aikin kowane rukuni, sannan ka nuna yadda za a ƙara iri-iri da abin da ake samu a gida.\",\ntools/p4-batch/merge-p4-bsci.mjs:35:  const uniqueIds = new Set(ids);\ntools/p4-batch/merge-p4-bsci.mjs:36:  if (uniqueIds.size !== ids.length) fail(\"batch contains duplicate ids\");\ntools/p4-batch/merge-p4-maths.mjs:35:  const uniqueIds = new Set(ids);\ntools/p4-batch/merge-p4-maths.mjs:36:  if (uniqueIds.size !== ids.length) fail(\"batch contains duplicate ids\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:160:function recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, type, detail = \"\") {\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:161:  failures.push({ moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, type, detail });\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:164:function assertValues(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors) {\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:166:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, \"answer below 0\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:169:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, \"distractor below 0\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:172:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, \"answer above 10,000\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:175:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, \"distractor above 10,000\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:178:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, variables, answer, distractors, \"distractor equals answer\");\ntools/p4-batch/check-p4-maths-formulas.mjs:181:    recordFailure(moduleId, questionIndex, var